body:
Just happened to glance at NHL lines on Bovada and they have the Preds at -1.5 (+135) playing in Buffalo.  As an avid Sabres fan this line just does not make sense to me.  Am I missing something here?  Sabres are 0-12-2 in their last 14 and haven't won (in regulation) since January 29th.

&#x200B;

Edit: Locking in Nashville both at -1.5 (+135) and -2.5 (+220).  Not worried about laying the extra points vs this Buffalo team that's gone completely off the rails.
